      uncertainties  = 'A platform project blueprint: a reasoned construction against the obligation, not an enumerated structure. Its parts follow the priority review criterion of the expedited-programs guidance (a serious condition; a significant improvement in safety or effectiveness), recalled; the guidance was not re-read. Minted 2026-11-13 from project-blueprint us_priority_review_sections. The regulator''s text was not re-read for this pack (regulator hosts are unreachable from the build environment). Not reviewed by a regulatory professional.'
    WHERE doc_type = 'priority_review' AND agency = 'fda' AND version = 'fda-priority-review-request-v1.0';
    UPDATE c2c_rule_packs SET
